[00:26.20]1. Jehovah anointed his Son
[00:31.36]To rule over ev’ryone.
[00:35.84]His throne is established on justice,
[00:41.28]That God’s will on earth may be done.
[00:46.58](Chorus)
[00:46.68]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed.
[00:51.76]Praise Jesus, O you faithful sheep,
[00:56.46]Who loyally follow day after day
[01:01.56]and all his commandments keep.
[01:06.54]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed,
[01:11.50]the Ruler of heavenly fame,
[01:16.76]Anointed with exultation and might
[01:22.18]to honor God’s holy name.
[01:45.42]2. Christ’s brothers are chosen and called.
[01:50.48]God gives them their own new birth.
[01:55.02]This bride class will share in the Kingdom
[02:00.64]And bring Paradise to this earth.
[02:05.36](Chorus)
[02:06.02]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed.
[02:10.96]Praise Jesus, O you faithful sheep,
[02:16.12]Who loyally follow day after day
[02:20.96]and all his commandments keep.
[02:26.16]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed,
[02:30.86]the Ruler of heavenly fame,
[02:36.46]Anointed with exultation and might
[03:08.62]to honor God’s holy name.
